ORA Object-T/U, Long-T/U | **7 cells × 5 = 35 missing files** |\n76\t\n77\t---\n78\t\n79\t## Registry Cross-Check\n80\t\n81\t### Registry DONE/success but server files incomplete\n82\t\n83\t| exp_id | Registry Status | Issue on Server |\n84\t|--------|----------------|-----------------|\n85\t| `nora_spatial_pipeline_v2` | DONE / success | `nora_spatial/untrained/` missing CF (3/5 not 5/5) |\n86\t\n87\t### Server has results but no corresponding single registry entry\n88\t\n89\tThe following directories have complete/near-complete results assembled from multiple legacy experiments rather than a single pipeline run:\n90\t- `libero_goal/` — 4/5 files from multiple older experiments (no single \"openvla_goal\" registry entry with conclusion=success)\n91\t- `libero_object/` + `libero_object_untrained/` — assembled across `object_pipeline_ridge_v2`, `object_untrained_pipeline_v1`, etc.\n92\t- `libero_long/` + `libero_long_untrained/` — assembled from `openvla_long_pipeline_v1` (failed) + `openvla_long_cf_trained` (success) + `openvla_long_untrained_v1` (success)\n93\t\n94\t### In-progress experiments filling gaps\n95\t\n96\t| exp_id | Status | Target Gaps |\n97\t|--------|--------|-------------|\n98\t| `openvla_goal_standardized_v1` | **RUNNING** | OpenVLA Goal trained + untrained (all 5 phases) |\n99\t| `openvla_spatial_standardized_v1` | **PREPARING** | OpenVLA Spatial trained + untrained (all 5 phases) |\n100\t| `cf_batch_missing_v1` | **RUNNING** | Untrained CF for multiple cells (openvla object untrained, tracvla spatial/object/goal/long untrained) |\n101\t\n102\t---\n103\t\n104\t## Legacy / Non-Standard Data\n105\t\n106\tThese directories contain related data in older formats, **not** in the standardized 5-phase structure:\n107\t\n108\t| Directory | Contents | Notes |\n109\t|-----------|----------|-------|\n110\t| `cross_instruction_spatial/` | `classification_results.json` | OpenVLA Spatial CI (legacy format) |\n111\t| `counterfactual_spatial/` | 6 files (per-condition + combined) | OpenVLA Spatial CF (legacy format) |\n112\t| `trained/`, `untrained/` (top-level) | `action_delta/`, `action_prediction/`, `temporal_distance/` | Old probe format (pre-standardization) |\n113\t| `trained_libero_goal/`, `untrained_libero_goal/` | Empty (0 json files) | Abandoned directories |\n114\t| `dinov2/`, `dinov2_libero_goal*/`, `oracle/`, etc. | Various old baselines | Control experiments, not part of 3×4 matrix |\n115\t\n116\t---\n117\t\n118\t## Critical Gaps Requiring Action\n119\t\n120\t### Priority 1: Entire cells missing (0/5)\n121\t1. **OpenVLA Spatial** (trained + untrained) — `openvla_spatial_standardized_v1` in PREPARING, needs to start\n122\t2. **NORA Object** (trained + untrained) — no experiment registered\n123\t3. **NORA Long** (trained + untrained) — no experiment registered\n124\t\n125\t### Priority 2: Phase gaps in otherwise-populated cells\n126\t4. **RSA missing across all TracVLA (8 cells) and all NORA (4 cells)** — systematic gap, 12 cells affected\n127\t5. **OpenVLA Goal trained** — missing CF only (1 file); `openvla_goal_standardized_v1` RUNNING should fill this\n128\t6. **OpenVLA Goal untrained** — `openvla_goal_standardized_v1` RUNNING should create this entire cell\n129\t7. **NORA Spatial untrained** — missing CF (registry says success but file absent)\n130\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XCAbMmQAGqoFNBwh8Xxaok","session_id":"8f610776-11c8-4d04-b7bf-e42114d5f5d3","uuid":"14dc36a7-e7e5-468d-a87b-0ffd635563da","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:23:00.714Z"}
