{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HMBvBZMGsciYmwZthmQSEr","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# vla-ssd — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-22 02:16 UTC | 更新原因: D095 framing upgrade + 实验状态更新 + 任务清理\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nVLA 微调如何重组 instruction routing——跨架构（OpenVLA/Llama-2, TraceVLA/Phi-3, NORA/Qwen2.5-VL）× 跨任务（4 LIBERO suites）一致性验证。详见 paper_framing.md（D095 cross-architecture upgrade）。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research 冲刺（矩阵最后 2 个 cell）+ 审稿迭代\\\\n- **实验**: 100 success / 17 negative / 5 failed / 146 total, 2 RUNNING\\\\n- **跨架构 R² exit collapse**: 9/10 cells 确认 trained Δ >> untrained Δ（architecture-independent）\\\\n- **D090 区分**: R² collapse + CF = training-induced; L1 heads = base-model-dependent\\\\n- **D094 三层级梯度**: VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA\\\\n- **D095 framing 升级**: paper_framing.md 已更新为跨架构版本，RC4 标记 addressed\\\\n- **TracVLA**: 4/4 suites 完整（trained+untrained），h13/h22 universal mixed heads（D091）\\\\n- **NORA**: 2/2 suites 完整（Goal+Spatial），Object/Long 无 checkpoint（D089）\\\\n- **OpenVLA**: Goal+Spatial standardized 补跑中（填 R²/L1/CF gaps），Object+Long 完整\\\\n\\\\n## 3×4 矩阵状态\\\\n\\\\n| | Goal | Spatial | Object | Long |\\\\n|--|------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| OpenVLA | 🔄 standardized running | 🔄 standardized running | ✅ full | ✅ full |\\\\n| TracVLA | ✅ full | ✅ full | ✅ full | ✅ full |\\\\n| NORA | ✅ full | ✅ (CF untrained 缺) | ❌ 无ckpt (D089) | ❌ 无ckpt (D089) |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] openvla_goal_standardized_v1 完成 → 提取结果更新矩阵（预计 ~1.5h）\\\\n- [ ] openvla_spatial_standardized_v1 完成 → 提取结果更新矩阵（预计 ~3-4h）\\\\n- [ ] NORA Spatial untrained CF 补跑（cuda:1 释放后，~15min）\\\\n- [ ] 矩阵完成后 → 激活 Paper Agent 更新论文（D095 跨架构 story）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate 评估升级后 claim 强度\\\\n- [x] paper_framing.md 跨架构升级 (D095)\\\\n- [x] TracVLA 4-suite trained+untrained 完整 (D091/D092)\\\\n- [x] NORA Goal+Spatial 完整 (D089)\\\\n- [x] OpenVLA Long trained CF 修复 + untrained 完成 (D093/D094)\\\\n- [x] cf_batch_missing_v1 补跑完成\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nwestd-19183: 2× GPU (cuda:0 openvla_spatial, cuda:1 openvla_goal)。两卡满载。\\\\n\\\\n## 系统问题\\\\n- Reviewer RESET 循环（33h+, escalated 3x Manager, 无回音）— 需要绕过\\\\n- Agent RESET 循环已缓解\\\\n\\\\n## DDL\\\\n- **Abstract: 2026-05-26（4天）**\\\\n- **Paper: 2026-05-29（7天）**\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D095 | 2026-05-22 | Paper framing 升级为跨架构版本：C2 从单架构观察升级为 3 arch × 4 sui | tracvla_object_untrained_v1, nora_goal_pipeline_v3, nora_spatial_pipeline_v2, tracvla_long_v1, openvla_long_cf_trained, openvla_long_untrained_v1 |\\\\n| D094 | 2026-05-21 | OpenVLA Long untrained (openvla-7b) 已有强 routing：L1 | openvla_long_untrained_v1 |\\\\n| D093 | 2026-05-21 | OpenVLA Long trained CF 完成：效应量中等 (d=0.45-0.57)，ord | openvla_long_cf_trained |\\\\n| D092 | 2026-05-21 | TracVLA 4-suite trained+untrained 全部完成。h13/h22 mix | tracvla_long_v1, tracvla_goal_v1 |\\\\n| D091 | 2026-05-21 | TracVLA 4-suite trained 一致性确认：L1 27-30/32, mixed h | tracvla_long_v1, tracvla_goal_v1 |\\\\n| D090 | 2026-05-21 | C2 framing 需细化：R² exit collapse 是 architecture-ind | tracvla_spatial_untrained_v1, tracvla_object_untrained_v1, nora_spatial_pipeline_v2 |\\\\n| D089 | 2026-05-21 | NORA 矩阵限定 Goal+Spatial（无 Object/Long checkpoint）；3 | nora_goal_pipeline_v3, nora_spatial_pipeline_v2 |\\\\n| D088 | 2026-05-21 | TracVLA Object untrained confirms training-induced | tracvla_object_untrained_v1, tracvla_object_full_v1 |\\\\n| D087 | 2026-05-20 | Closed-loop behavioral validation confirmed infeas | phi3v_r2_untrained_probe, phi3v_r2_seed_expansion |\\\\n| D086 | 2026-05-20 | Phi3V untrained probe confirms inverted-U is train | phi3v_r2_untrained_probe, phi3v_r2_seed_expansion, phi3v_r2_action_probe |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3372, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Fkf1rVNGL1iMs2op5SNsMN","session_id":"8f610776-11c8-4d04-b7bf-e42114d5f5d3","uuid":"6a076f45-749a-4754-9973-777668be2a02","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:23:34.347Z"}
